<figure id="S4.T7" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span><span id="S4.T7.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Overview (descriptive): <math id="S4.T7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P(\text{SPICE=YES})\pm\text{SE}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">SPICE=YES</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>±</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">SE</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P(\text{SPICE=YES})\pm\text{SE}</annotation></semantics></math> (binomial, Wald) and sample size by Model <math id="S4.T7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> Tone, plus an Overall row.</span></figcaption>
<table id="S4.T7.6" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S4.T7.6.1" class="ltx_tr">
